[TITLE]
synthetic gate deck: [USER_FLAGS] and [USER_FLAG_VALUES] (schema, every value type, a
redefined flag, an unknown type, a value for an undefined flag, mixed-case names)
[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CFS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE
START_DATE 01/01/2026
START_TIME 00:00:00
END_DATE 01/01/2026
END_TIME 01:00:00
