[JUNCTIONS]
J1 100 10 0 0 0
J2 99 10 0 0 0
[OUTFALLS]
O1 98 FREE NO
[CONDUITS]
C1 J1 J2 400 0.013 0 0 0 0
C2 J2 O1 400 0.013 0 0 0 0
